ating\":0,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20967741935483872,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":2,\"title\":\"Clerks\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xunXvzFlkf1GGgMkCySA9CCFumB.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2090909090909091,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":3817,\"title\":\"The Land Before Time\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p4eUTWcyh5U62Y26HkALQQjdwMF.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2090909090909091,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":441,\"title\":\"Father of the Pride\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eJ8kqnWfgeYb1XyKmRXCBs599pa.jpg\",\"rating\":5.1,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.20833333333333334,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":2,\"seasonName\":\"Season 2\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4XNFQRFTfskAtCy2nkNfpIVTPOK.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2017-07-07\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Babysitter Bunga\",\"overview\":\"The rest of the Lion Guard is stunned when Bunga becomes the go-to babysitter for all the Pride Lands' parents.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4dTNaDS6GG5EopLtDuphrO4dK0G.jpg\",\"rating\":9.7,\"voteCount\":3,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-07\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"The Savannah Summit\",\"overview\":\"While Simba gathers the animal leaders for a Savannah Summit, the Lion Guard learns of a plot against Twiga the giraffe.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uk74PYkckANgp3TwtfyOMtMLlHO.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-07\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"The Traveling Baboon Show\",\"overview\":\"The Lion Guard chase away a baboon comedy troupe that has been distracting the other animals with their antics and stealing their food.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/19LFDWsboSbnwD2QJ2swZxTrxE3.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-14\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Ono and the Egg\",\"overview\":\"Ono begrudgingly becomes the protector of a cuckoo bird's egg left in his nest and chases off an African harrier hawk who has come to the Pride Lands to hunt for tasty new treats.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mhwiQIkmHI9hhlRDYmmolsieajH.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-21\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"The Rise of Scar\",\"overview\":\"The Guard meets Rafiki's new apprentice Monkiki. Meanwhile, Ushari and the hyenas team up to seek the help of the Pride Lands' greatest villain, Scar.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c8XKagrvtwlATg9oNnJraGrS51b.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-29\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Let Sleeping Crocs Lie\",\"overview\":\"After the Lion Guard accidentally wakes the aestivating crocodiles, the crocs are furious they have to suffer through the dry season!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iYq3g28sfyb2CMcT8CMFYO65Mmk.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-08-11\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Swept Away\",\"overview\":\"When Beshte ends up alone in the Outlands, Scar uses the opportunity to attack the Lion Guard's strongest member.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xRU57w1dSGbEuTcyDS4BXOobhjg.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-15\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Rafiki's New Neighbors\",\"overview\":\"When a noisy bachelor herd moves in next door to Rafiki's tree, the Lion Guard try to help the animals find new homes.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uk0CYIg6OWfzWYTeJCA8MtMxqE1.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-22\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Rescue in the Outlands\",\"overview\":\"When Jasiri and two hyena cubs are in danger in the Outlands, the Guard enlists the help of Thurston the Zebra to repel a tsetse fly infestation slowing down their rescue efforts.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c8Qe1Tntc39kh0VinwW7DCR5euI.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-09-29\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"The Ukumbusho Tradition\",\"overview\":\"Makini and the Guard are excited to attend their first Ukumbusho but bees threaten to ruin the important celebration!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gVE2ymWjbW3rk98wLRxqD21iO1u.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-10-27\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"The Bite of Kenge\",\"overview\":\"To help the hyenas steal melons, a Monitor Lizard bites Kion, Fuli and Beshte which temporarily paralyzes them!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aOUxEZopCItJH4dBMy5LweSZWFs.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-11-03\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Timon and Pumbaa's Christmas\",\"overview\":\"Bunga and the Lion Guard enlist the help of other animals to perform \\\"The Twelve Ways of Christmas\\\" so Timon and Pumbaa can have a \\\"real\\\" Christmas.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qzy8WIVtE8Sy0Z7AegPfLGCbYY1.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2017-12-08\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"The Morning Report\",\"overview\":\"When Scar has the hyenas trap and interrogate Zazu, the Guard must rescue him.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1M0bBg5KpJTyTQfcHqUGe2XDcJj.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-08\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"The Golden Zebra\",\"overview\":\"Facing a water shortage in the Pride Lands, the Lion Guard must appease zebra leader, Dhahabu, to gain access to a new watering hole.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5708jMNKpsGt4UPZa6DT8llShNy.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-09\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"The Little Guy\",\"overview\":\"Beshte makes friends with a little gecko named Hodari who wants to be a crocodile more than anything else in the world!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8c317XNnz5dUOtvPKdoYJ2s6mMK.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-10\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Divide and Conquer\",\"overview\":\"When the guard is up against two attacks at once, Kion enlists the help of Tamaa the Drongo to help them be in two places at once.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/87IFvj8pjf78E7qi7ri6XVuR50C.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-01-11\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"The Scorpion's Sting\",\"overview\":\"After a scorpion sent by Scar stings Simba, the Guard needs to face every villain in the Outlands to get a cure for the king!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f7JvACOVR40bGwGe8AfO1Kn1gQe.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-04-02\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"The Wisdom of Kongwe\",\"overview\":\"Fuli and Makini are tasked with escorting one of the Pride Lands' wisest animals, a tortoise named Kongwe, back to Pride Rock to meet with the King.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5EJXjlfgfwxCkHm1yrQMgxIKUyd.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-04-03\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"The Kilio Valley Fire\",\"overview\":\"After Scar's minions set fire to the Kilio Valley, the misplaced elephants are forced to the Pride Lands and create chaos amongst the other herds.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q5IAkJSiqH50KJ5Vvc6OfaCPjec.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-04-04\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Undercover Kinyonga\",\"overview\":\"A color-changing chameleon named Kinyonga helps the Guard by spying on Scar in the Outlands.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yvOk3NQGEibrYGXToAvBXaSU122.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-04-05\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Cave of Secrets\",\"overview\":\"After discovering a mysterious cave that may hold the key to defeating Scar, the Guard must face dangerous hazards to uncover its secrets.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xgIOkZ0jBaMW0ae9LwGDQHzUyQy.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-04\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"The Zebra Mastermind\",\"overview\":\"After hearing Thurston boast that he's the brains behind the Lion Guard, the villains of the Outlands capture him to find a way to defeat the Guard.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fjqAkuWX9n1ROyG4upCAaLeAZn9.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-05\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"The Hyena Resistance\",\"overview\":\"Jasiri offers to help the Guard battle Scar by forming a Hyena Resistance in the Outlands.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2oYu6o8Ekx2fG670aftPz6SyB5w.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-06\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"The Underground Adventure\",\"overview\":\"Kion, Kiara, Bunga, Tiifu and Zuri must journey underground through aardvark tunnels to escape a fire.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aEU2nHhOiNOr3Ou0oKAIrkrdBQ5.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-09-07\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"Beshte and the Beast\",\"overview\":\"A gorilla warrior named Shujaa comes to help the Lion Guard in the battle against Scar.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6TdRADf0C2xXLDqxnT1JQvzV1Jr.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2018-11-12\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":26,\"name\":\"Pride Landers Unite!\",\"overview\":\"Kion, is tasked with gathering the Pride Landers to prepare them for their fight against Scar.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fWWDeDqrgNC5CLIGmHPB4XHtDIv.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-01-21\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":27,\"name\":\"The Queen's Visit\",\"overview\":\"After being threatened by Scar's attacks, Queen Dhahabu asks Fuli, Tiifu and Zuri to become her permanent personal guards.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mowkGUsWWrvJvpCOf2pjGohFCRB.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-02-18\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":28,\"name\":\"The Fall of Mizimu Grove\",\"overview\":\"Scar makes an appearance when Timon and Pumbaa decide to put on a show in Mizimu Grove.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8fuuiSx5VHCKhWIBq11ZROUhD9L.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-03-25\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":29,\"name\":\"Fire From the Sky\",\"overview\":\"To combat the vultures dropping flame sticks from the sky, the Lion Guard seeks help from Hadithi and a Martial eagle named Anga.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yRobhKHvn0TCzaERCqIECfXxEHy.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-04-22\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2016-01-15\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}